{
  "title_zh": "林深处",
  "title_en": "Deeper into the Trees",
  "title_ja": "木立の奥へ",
  "order": 20,
  "draft": false,
  "statement_zh": "再往里走，光就只剩下缝隙。人影退进枝叶之间，像一句没说完的话，留在林子深处。",
  "statement_en": "Further in, the light is only what slips between the branches. She steps back into the leaves like a sentence left unfinished, somewhere deep among the trees.",
  "statement_ja": "奥へ進むほど、光は枝のすきまにしか残らない。人影は葉のあいだへ退き、言いかけた言葉のように、木立の奥にとどまる。",
